When that whistle blow
we unleash hell today!

00:16:39.072 --> 00:16:42.322
When that whistle blow we unleash hell!

00:16:45.971 --> 00:16:48.417
It's a man's game tonight
now you know that.

00:16:48.417 --> 00:16:49.989
It's a man's game tonight.

00:16:49.989 --> 00:16:51.072
